@startuml shelter-feed-flow
title Feed v2 - celebrar e comentar

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

actor "Pessoa logada" as U
participant "App (feed)" as App
participant "FeedCelebrationController" as CC
participant "UpdateCelebrationService" as US
participant "GetImageSectionService" as SS
database "MySQL" as DB

== Celebrar (alternar) ==
U -> App : clique em "Celebrar"
App -> App : otimista: +1 / -1 e aria-pressed
App -> CC : POST /feed-sections/:id/celebration/toggle
CC -> CC : JwtAuthGuard + flags shelter_feed e shelter_feed_celebrations
CC -> US : toggle(sectionId, userId)
US -> SS : assertFeedSectionVisible (404 se oculta)
US -> DB : DELETE (seção, usuário)
alt nada removido
  US -> DB : INSERT (ER_DUP_ENTRY é absorvido)
end
US --> App : { count, celebratedByMe } (verdade do servidor)
App -> App : reconcilia; em erro, rollback + aviso

== Comentar (nasce pendente) ==
U -> App : envia comentário (requestId novo)
App -> "FeedPhotoCommentController" : POST /feed-sections/:id/comments
"FeedPhotoCommentController" -> "CreateFeedCommentService" : create(actor, texto, requestId)
"CreateFeedCommentService" -> SS : assertFeedSectionVisible
"CreateFeedCommentService" -> "CreateFeedCommentService" : normaliza, limite 500, recusa e-mail/telefone/link
"CreateFeedCommentService" -> DB : já existe (autor, requestId)?
alt reenvio com o mesmo texto
  "CreateFeedCommentService" --> App : o mesmo comentário (sem duplicar, sem e-mail)
else mesmo requestId, outro texto
  "CreateFeedCommentService" --> App : 409
else novo
  "CreateFeedCommentService" -> DB : limite de envios por minuto, INSERT status=pending
  "CreateFeedCommentService" ->> "FeedCommentNotificationService" : e-mail aos admins (flag email_feed_comment_pending)
  "CreateFeedCommentService" --> App : comentário pendente
  App -> App : "Seu comentário foi enviado e aguarda aprovação"
end

== Ver comentários ==
U -> App : abre os comentários
App -> "FeedPhotoCommentController" : GET /feed-sections/:id/comments (só APROVADOS, para todos)
App -> "FeedPhotoCommentController" : GET /feed-sections/:id/comments/mine (os do autor, qualquer status, com o motivo)
note right of DB : commentCount do feed conta só aprovados

== Moderar (admin) ==
actor "Admin" as A
A -> App : painel /adm/comentarios-feed
App -> "FeedPhotoCommentController" : GET /feed-section-comments/moderation (status, busca, página) e /moderation/pending-count
A -> App : aprova ou reprova (motivo obrigatório)
App -> "FeedPhotoCommentController" : PATCH /feed-section-comments/:id/approve | /reject
"FeedPhotoCommentController" -> "UpdateFeedCommentService" : decide(admin)
"UpdateFeedCommentService" -> DB : UPDATE ... WHERE status = pending
alt já estava na mesma decisão
  "UpdateFeedCommentService" --> App : 200 idempotente, sem novo e-mail
else decisão contrária sobre já moderado
  "UpdateFeedCommentService" --> App : 409
else decidiu
  "UpdateFeedCommentService" ->> "FeedCommentNotificationService" : e-mail ao autor (email_feed_comment_approved | email_feed_comment_rejected)
  "UpdateFeedCommentService" --> App : comentário atualizado
end

== Remover ==
U -> App : remover comentário
App -> "FeedPhotoCommentController" : DELETE /feed-section-comments/:id
"FeedPhotoCommentController" -> "DeleteFeedCommentService" : remove(actor)
"DeleteFeedCommentService" -> DB : autor remove o seu (qualquer status); admin remove qualquer (403 para os demais)
@enduml
